I go outside.
Today is Sunday.
The street here is quiet.
I remember my family.
My family is in Mexico.
My sister is Sofia.
Her voice is in my mind.
My brother is Diego.
His laugh is also in my mind.
Lola is my dog.
She is a good dog.
I am a little sad.
But the walk here is pleasant.
Mumbai's morning is beautiful.
Who is on the street?
One dog sleeps on the street.
I walk slowly.
Now I am peaceful.
My new home is here.
